WEBVTT

01:55.070 --> 01:55.870
Xiao Chi,

01:56.840 --> 01:58.240
if there were no more wars

01:58.680 --> 02:01.230
at Tianlang Pass,

02:02.280 --> 02:04.150
you could return to the capital

02:04.480 --> 02:06.000
and stay with me and Fei Zheng

02:06.000 --> 02:07.070
for years to come.

02:07.350 --> 02:08.630
Wouldn't that be wonderful?

02:08.630 --> 02:09.310
Chu,

02:09.590 --> 02:10.400
Tianlang Pass

02:11.520 --> 02:13.450
is Jinglan's most important pass.

02:14.030 --> 02:16.079
For the nation and the people,

02:16.360 --> 02:17.960
I will definitely defend it.

02:19.680 --> 02:21.360
Only

02:22.630 --> 02:23.800
for the nation?

02:25.240 --> 02:27.030
Only for the people?

02:30.400 --> 02:31.200
Your Majesty,

02:31.800 --> 02:33.590
what Xiao Chi means is that

02:34.030 --> 02:36.960
since you're the pillar of Jinglan,

02:37.680 --> 02:40.079
protecting the people
is also protecting you.

02:40.079 --> 02:41.280
Zheng is right.

02:41.430 --> 02:42.750
I am defending

02:42.750 --> 02:44.010
Tianlang Pass for you.

02:47.750 --> 02:50.750
Appointing Fei Zheng
as the Minister of Rites

02:51.000 --> 02:53.630
was indeed a wise move.

03:56.000 --> 03:57.329
The Acupuncture Manual

03:57.430 --> 03:59.829
seems to mention a way
to treat memory loss.

04:20.800 --> 04:24.070
Neiguan regulates qi
and relaxes the tendons.

04:30.270 --> 04:31.480
Neiguan…

04:34.270 --> 04:36.930
Shenmen nourishes
the heart and calms the mind.

04:38.480 --> 04:39.270
Shenmen...

04:42.870 --> 04:43.950
Come, brothers,

04:43.950 --> 04:45.409
let's have another drink.

04:57.950 --> 04:58.680
Fei Zheng,

04:59.159 --> 05:00.490
are you feeling unwell?

05:01.070 --> 05:02.000
Your Majesty,

05:02.390 --> 05:03.270
the weather

05:03.270 --> 05:04.480
has turned colder

05:04.480 --> 05:05.630
these past few days.

05:06.040 --> 05:08.430
I’m afraid I’ve caught a chill.

05:08.950 --> 05:10.680
A little rest should be enough.

05:12.480 --> 05:13.830
Yes.

05:15.830 --> 05:17.190
It's getting cold.

05:19.270 --> 05:20.630
Zheng, then

05:22.390 --> 05:23.990
you shouldn't go out for now.

05:28.750 --> 05:29.560
Your Majesty,

05:30.120 --> 05:31.580
you are absolutely right.

05:35.600 --> 05:36.830
I really must finish

05:37.159 --> 05:39.290
We should finish this last pot of wine.

05:40.480 --> 05:41.390
I deserve it.

05:43.000 --> 05:43.800
I deserve it.

05:53.270 --> 05:54.070
Zheng,

05:58.240 --> 06:00.480
your cold seems to have gotten worse.

06:01.600 --> 06:02.600
Send for the Imperial Physician.

06:02.600 --> 06:03.400
Your Majesty,

06:07.040 --> 06:08.800
didn't I just say?

06:09.630 --> 06:10.630
It’s only a chill.

06:11.680 --> 06:13.340
Let's not bother anyone else.

06:15.830 --> 06:16.890
Zheng, let me taste

06:17.390 --> 06:18.430
what makes your wine

06:18.430 --> 06:19.830
any different from mine?

06:20.160 --> 06:22.290
I'll toast Your Majesty on his behalf.

06:26.000 --> 06:28.430
That’s my good Third Brother.

06:29.190 --> 06:31.870
Truly worthy of being Jinglan’s
great General Xiao.

06:31.870 --> 06:32.680
Well,

06:33.560 --> 06:34.830
I'll drink this pot.

06:38.560 --> 06:39.680
You drink this one.

07:11.360 --> 07:12.160
Your Majesty,

07:12.480 --> 07:14.560
the three of us grew up together.

07:14.800 --> 07:15.870
You know me best.

07:16.160 --> 07:17.240
I'm impulsive

07:17.630 --> 07:18.890
and prone to mistakes.

07:22.750 --> 07:24.150
If I make a grave mistake,

07:24.680 --> 07:25.390
Chu,

07:25.830 --> 07:27.040
will you forgive me?

07:28.430 --> 07:29.750
Xiao Chi,

07:30.600 --> 07:33.360
you've guarded
Tianlang Pass for so many years.

07:33.560 --> 07:35.220
What mistakes could you make?

07:35.830 --> 07:37.480
Since you returned to the capital,

07:37.480 --> 07:39.610
you haven’t really come to see me much—

07:40.000 --> 07:41.310
but

07:41.310 --> 07:42.800
I know your nature.

07:43.480 --> 07:44.480
Straightforward

07:45.120 --> 07:45.850
and sincere.

07:46.480 --> 07:48.140
What mistakes could you make?

07:49.070 --> 07:49.870
What?

07:50.560 --> 07:51.510
Could it be

07:52.720 --> 07:54.270
you also want to kill me?

07:56.560 --> 07:57.600
I would never.

08:03.950 --> 08:06.800
If both of you want to harm me,

08:07.830 --> 08:09.090
then in all of Jinglan,

08:10.360 --> 08:13.240
there is truly no one I can trust.

08:13.750 --> 08:14.720
Your Majesty.

08:15.120 --> 08:16.040
Say no more.

08:16.870 --> 08:18.070
I am

08:18.750 --> 08:19.680
a bit tired,

08:20.680 --> 08:22.280
and I've had enough to drink.

08:22.360 --> 08:22.830
Chu!

08:22.830 --> 08:23.270
We...

08:25.160 --> 08:26.490
I have one more request.

08:35.750 --> 08:36.549
Tell me.

08:37.030 --> 08:37.669
Chu,

08:38.440 --> 08:39.000
if...

08:39.000 --> 08:40.080
Xiao Chi.

08:41.480 --> 08:42.679
His Majesty is tired.

08:44.150 --> 08:45.840
His Majesty needs to rest.

08:48.480 --> 08:49.280
Your Majesty,

08:50.240 --> 08:52.670
my body is truly failing me today.

08:53.960 --> 08:55.000
I beg Your Majesty

08:55.750 --> 08:57.030
to let me go back

08:57.750 --> 08:59.150
alone.

09:01.030 --> 09:01.840
All right.

09:02.870 --> 09:03.670
Someone,

09:04.670 --> 09:06.120
help Lord Fei

09:06.600 --> 09:07.860
back to his residence.

09:24.480 --> 09:25.280
Your Majesty,

09:27.480 --> 09:28.670
I will take my leave.

09:29.840 --> 09:31.440
Thank you for your hard work.

09:44.960 --> 09:46.200
Sit down and talk.

09:47.360 --> 09:48.220
Thank you, Chu.

09:50.200 --> 09:52.000
I know what you are going to say.

09:53.030 --> 09:54.440
The three of us

09:54.440 --> 09:56.000
grew up together;

09:56.960 --> 09:58.270
we’re like brothers.

09:59.080 --> 09:59.910
You,

10:00.720 --> 10:01.600
Fei Zheng,

10:02.240 --> 10:05.200
will always be my closest.

10:08.080 --> 10:09.320
Don't worry.

10:10.000 --> 10:12.670
Even if you and Fei Zheng
commit a serious crime,

10:13.960 --> 10:15.670
I will pardon you.

10:16.600 --> 10:17.440
Chu,

10:17.630 --> 10:18.560
are you serious?

10:20.080 --> 10:20.870
Of course.

10:21.790 --> 10:23.000
I am the Emperor.

10:23.670 --> 10:27.240
The Emperor's word is his bond.

10:34.480 --> 10:37.480
Baihui clears the mind
and sharpens the eyes.

10:37.480 --> 10:38.270
Baihui?

10:40.000 --> 10:42.150
You can't just carelessly
needle the Baihui acupoint.

10:42.150 --> 10:43.480
It could go wrong.

10:46.600 --> 10:47.550
Whatever.

10:47.550 --> 10:48.610
Let's give it a try.

11:12.630 --> 11:13.830
This river is so deep.

11:14.000 --> 11:15.240
If you fall in,

11:15.240 --> 11:16.480
we'll both die.

11:18.240 --> 11:19.750
Then how should I thank Miss Han?

11:19.750 --> 11:20.720
The best way to thank me

11:20.720 --> 11:22.270
is to get well soon.

11:24.030 --> 11:25.790
I will also go to battle,

11:25.790 --> 11:27.150
defend the people of Jinglan—

11:27.150 --> 11:28.550
and protect you as well.

11:41.550 --> 11:43.240
Then, did you

11:43.440 --> 11:45.360
forget any important friends
due to that?

11:45.360 --> 11:46.630
How is that possible?

11:46.630 --> 11:47.080
I...

11:56.440 --> 11:58.360
Don't touch me!

11:58.720 --> 11:59.510
It's me.

11:59.510 --> 12:00.360
I'm Xiao Chi.

12:08.870 --> 12:10.670
Aren't you afraid I might harm you?

12:10.670 --> 12:12.200
If so, I'll return this life

12:12.440 --> 12:13.240
to you.

12:15.200 --> 12:16.440
Xiao Chi.

12:17.360 --> 12:19.390
You are everyone's only hope now.

12:19.390 --> 12:20.080
And,

12:21.750 --> 12:24.280
I don't want anything
to happen to you either.

12:39.790 --> 12:40.600
Xiao Chi!

12:41.960 --> 12:42.890
Why are you here?

12:44.390 --> 12:45.520
Where are you going?

12:46.600 --> 12:47.400
To the palace.

12:48.030 --> 12:49.230
When will you be back?

12:51.080 --> 12:53.270
I'll be back as soon as I finish my work.

13:12.870 --> 13:13.870
Come back soon.

13:17.390 --> 13:18.510
Hurry up and go.

13:19.840 --> 13:20.360
Okay.

13:24.670 --> 13:26.030
Come back soon.

13:37.080 --> 13:38.480
Greetings, Your Majesty.

13:38.480 --> 13:39.750
Please rise.

13:39.750 --> 13:41.150
Thank you, Your Majesty.

13:44.480 --> 13:46.340
Did you drink too much last night?

13:46.840 --> 13:48.440
I drank too much anyway.

13:48.870 --> 13:51.000
It's the first time I've seen Fei Zheng

13:51.240 --> 13:52.440
drink himself

13:52.440 --> 13:54.030
into such an embarrassing state.

13:54.030 --> 13:55.030
Lord Fei and I

13:55.360 --> 13:57.760
naturally cannot compare to Your Majesty.

13:59.480 --> 14:01.080
I asked you to come here today

14:01.440 --> 14:03.170
to discuss something with you.

14:05.720 --> 14:06.580
Your Highness,

14:07.150 --> 14:08.200
have some grapes.

14:09.030 --> 14:11.480
King of Mo specially
asked the envoys to bring these over.

14:11.480 --> 14:13.010
He picked them all himself.

14:25.150 --> 14:26.150
Are they not good?

14:26.440 --> 14:28.370
They don't taste like they used to.

14:29.790 --> 14:30.630
What's wrong?

14:31.000 --> 14:32.670
Did something unpleasant happen

14:32.670 --> 14:34.720
with the Emperor today?

14:39.120 --> 14:39.910
Sit.

14:42.840 --> 14:43.970
Liu Chu has changed.

14:44.480 --> 14:45.810
He's become a stranger.

14:46.360 --> 14:47.890
He wasn't like this before.

14:49.480 --> 14:51.720
Ever since I was little, my father told me

14:51.720 --> 14:53.720
I must love Liu Chu wholeheartedly,

14:54.630 --> 14:55.790
and I did.

14:56.750 --> 14:59.350
Day and night,
I imagined what he would be like.

15:00.480 --> 15:02.280
I crossed mountains and rivers,

15:02.480 --> 15:05.340
enduring injuries and hardship,
just to marry him.

15:05.440 --> 15:07.570
I even became pregnant with his child,

15:07.750 --> 15:09.350
planning to give birth to it.

15:12.030 --> 15:13.630
What is all this for?

15:16.630 --> 15:17.510
Maybe

15:18.390 --> 15:20.630
this is what we have to endure.

15:21.390 --> 15:22.390
This is fate.

15:26.440 --> 15:27.300
Your Highness,

15:27.630 --> 15:29.030
no matter what others do,

15:29.200 --> 15:31.200
I will definitely stay by your side.

15:36.440 --> 15:37.870
I hope this child

15:38.600 --> 15:40.260
can bring Changmo and Jinglan

15:40.910 --> 15:42.390
peace and tranquility.

15:52.270 --> 15:53.080
Jin Xi,

15:54.840 --> 15:56.390
you will always stay by my side,

15:56.390 --> 15:57.240
right?

15:58.080 --> 15:59.750
I will always be with you.

16:48.550 --> 16:49.480
I heard

16:49.670 --> 16:53.390
someone has been sneaking out of the palace
at night for secret meetings lately.

16:53.390 --> 16:54.200
I want you

16:54.600 --> 16:56.860
to thoroughly investigate this matter.

16:57.360 --> 16:58.320
I wouldn't dare.

16:58.320 --> 16:59.270
How dare I interfere

16:59.270 --> 17:01.000
in palace affairs?

17:01.390 --> 17:02.270
Chi,

17:02.600 --> 17:03.870
besides you,

17:04.589 --> 17:06.440
there is no one I trust.

17:17.829 --> 17:19.430
The direction of the clinic?

17:22.880 --> 17:23.829
Jin Xi?

17:26.240 --> 17:27.270
Why are you here?

17:27.790 --> 17:28.880
Han Mo has already been saved.

17:28.880 --> 17:30.740
You should hurry back to Changmo.

17:31.030 --> 17:32.960
Even though the two countries
are connected by marriage now

17:32.960 --> 17:34.240
and it seems peaceful,

17:34.480 --> 17:35.160
but...

17:36.480 --> 17:39.160
Remember to protect yourself.

17:39.270 --> 17:41.030
What are you talking about?

17:41.480 --> 17:43.200
Aren't we doing fine now?

17:43.680 --> 17:45.400
I just want you to be safe

17:45.400 --> 17:46.750
and live happily.

17:48.240 --> 17:49.030
Jin Xi.

17:51.030 --> 17:51.880
Jin Xi!

17:59.030 --> 18:00.790
What does this even mean?

18:08.640 --> 18:09.680
Xiao Chi?

18:45.350 --> 18:47.080
The poison has flared up again?

18:47.200 --> 18:48.070
You're here.

18:50.640 --> 18:52.440
This is already the second time.

18:54.030 --> 18:56.000
Why didn't you
take the antidote I gave you?

18:56.000 --> 18:57.030
I told you,

18:57.960 --> 18:59.440
this antidote is for you.

18:59.830 --> 19:00.750
Take it.

19:02.200 --> 19:03.240
You must hold on.

19:04.030 --> 19:05.760
Once Changmo invades Jinglan,

19:06.590 --> 19:08.190
we will all get the antidote.

19:08.830 --> 19:09.920
Then,

19:09.920 --> 19:11.480
we will regain our freedom.

19:12.880 --> 19:14.000
Gain freedom?

19:15.550 --> 19:16.790
As spies,

19:17.590 --> 19:18.850
you and I know too much.

19:20.550 --> 19:21.790
Do you really think

19:22.590 --> 19:24.030
Meng Ling will let us go?

19:28.160 --> 19:29.620
Let's not talk about this.

19:30.070 --> 19:32.130
Hurry up and take the antidote first.

19:32.960 --> 19:33.690
Don't worry.

19:34.000 --> 19:35.200
I am highly skilled in martial arts.

19:35.200 --> 19:37.460
I can definitely hold out until that day.

19:51.480 --> 19:52.310
I'm fine.

19:53.030 --> 19:53.790
Take it.

20:05.000 --> 20:06.600
Once Prince Mo kills Liu Chu,

20:07.350 --> 20:08.790
we can follow the Princess

20:08.790 --> 20:10.250
back to Changmo together.

20:10.440 --> 20:11.640
When that time comes,

20:12.000 --> 20:13.590
we will find a free place,

20:15.200 --> 20:16.800
and I will always be with you.

20:30.680 --> 20:32.200
One is a brother

20:32.200 --> 20:34.160
who has stayed by His Majesty’s side
for many years,

20:34.160 --> 20:36.240
the other is the princess’s
female official—

20:36.240 --> 20:37.400
yet both are spies.

20:37.880 --> 20:39.160
How ironic.

20:39.880 --> 20:40.880
To survive,

20:41.160 --> 20:42.160
I must kill him.

20:50.070 --> 20:50.880
Xiao Chi,

20:53.070 --> 20:54.670
I was indeed sent by Changmo.

20:55.830 --> 20:57.290
But after all these years,

20:57.550 --> 20:58.960
you know what kind of person I am.

20:58.960 --> 21:01.270
You know very well

21:02.200 --> 21:03.480
how much I've done for Chu and Jinglan.

21:03.480 --> 21:04.350
I know.

21:04.830 --> 21:05.960
But so what?

21:06.160 --> 21:07.350
Changmo has never given up

21:07.350 --> 21:09.150
the idea of destroying Jinglan.

21:09.480 --> 21:10.880
I am now poisoned by Gu

21:11.270 --> 21:12.670
that flares up every day.

21:13.070 --> 21:14.030
Even so,

21:15.030 --> 21:15.920
I have never once thought of

21:15.920 --> 21:17.480
betraying anyone.

21:17.480 --> 21:19.740
Not reporting what you know is betrayal.

21:20.680 --> 21:22.960
You even let spies stay around you.

21:23.270 --> 21:24.530
That is also betrayal.

21:26.590 --> 21:28.590
Fate really plays tricks on people.

21:29.270 --> 21:30.270
But you know what?

21:30.590 --> 21:33.030
We don't always have a choice in life.

21:35.030 --> 21:36.160
But you chose

21:36.720 --> 21:38.030
this path yourself.

21:39.680 --> 21:41.480
There's no point in saying more.

21:41.480 --> 21:42.270
Fei Zheng,

21:42.790 --> 21:43.720
draw your sword.

21:44.880 --> 21:45.550
Today,

21:46.030 --> 21:47.270
you have to kill me

21:47.830 --> 21:48.890
before leaving.【】

21:52.750 --> 21:53.550
Fine.

21:55.030 --> 21:56.030
For so many years,

21:57.030 --> 21:58.400
we haven't fought.

21:59.550 --> 22:00.480
Then today,

22:01.400 --> 22:02.550
let me test

22:02.550 --> 22:03.640
your swordsmanship, Chi.

22:03.640 --> 22:04.880
Don't call me Chi.

22:42.070 --> 22:42.880
Fei Zheng!

22:50.880 --> 22:52.030
I can let you go,

22:52.350 --> 22:54.610
but you must leave Jinglan immediately.

22:55.070 --> 22:55.600
Xiao Chi.

22:55.680 --> 22:56.680
Say another word,

22:56.960 --> 22:58.020
and I'll regret it.

22:59.640 --> 23:00.440
All right.

23:01.480 --> 23:02.270
Let's go.

23:18.680 --> 23:19.480
Goodbye,

23:22.000 --> 23:22.790
Zheng.

23:23.830 --> 23:26.030
The Emperor has arrived!

23:39.880 --> 23:40.680
Your Majesty.

23:41.640 --> 23:44.300
You just let two spies
from Changmo go like that?

23:49.270 --> 23:50.350
General Xiao,

23:51.350 --> 23:52.110
tell me,

23:52.350 --> 23:54.030
how should spies from Changmo

23:54.880 --> 23:56.480
be dealt with

23:57.680 --> 23:59.210
according to military law?

24:01.750 --> 24:02.680
Your Majesty,

24:03.880 --> 24:05.270
they should be
put in the Imperial Prison

24:05.270 --> 24:06.870
and strictly interrogated.

24:07.030 --> 24:07.880
Arrest them.

24:08.480 --> 24:09.270
Chu.

24:09.790 --> 24:10.750
Chu,

24:10.750 --> 24:11.880
you promised me that

24:12.240 --> 24:13.700
if Chu made a huge mistake,

24:14.030 --> 24:15.290
you would forgive him.

24:18.830 --> 24:20.310
Since I promised you,

24:21.440 --> 24:23.200
I will definitely do it.

24:24.240 --> 24:25.510
But facing

24:25.510 --> 24:28.200
a spy from Changmo
who hid in Jinglan for years,

24:29.400 --> 24:31.440
I have a lot to ask him.

24:32.270 --> 24:34.350
If he can confess everything,

24:35.480 --> 24:37.440
I will surely keep my promise.

24:37.880 --> 24:39.280
Thank you, Your Majesty.

24:39.750 --> 24:40.830
As for her,

24:41.590 --> 24:42.960
if she doesn't behave,

24:43.030 --> 24:44.690
I can't guarantee her safety.

24:46.640 --> 24:47.480
Your Majesty!

24:50.160 --> 24:52.000
Your Majesty, please don't kill her.

24:52.000 --> 24:52.830
You promised me

24:52.830 --> 24:53.830
that since I saved your life,

24:53.830 --> 24:55.560
you would grant me one request.

24:55.960 --> 24:57.750
Jin Xi is my childhood sister.

24:58.030 --> 24:59.400
I beg you to spare her.

24:59.480 --> 25:00.750
Please let her go.

25:00.750 --> 25:02.080
I beg you, Your Majesty.

25:02.510 --> 25:03.830
You two—

25:05.200 --> 25:07.160
one wants to save his brother,

25:08.030 --> 25:09.830
the other wants to save her sister.

25:09.830 --> 25:10.680
Then what do

25:10.680 --> 25:12.110
you take me for?

25:12.880 --> 25:15.960
When have I ever not treated you
as my brothers,

25:16.400 --> 25:17.680
as my family?

25:21.030 --> 25:22.240
Changmo spies

25:22.240 --> 25:24.200
are now disturbing the people of Jinglan

25:24.200 --> 25:25.480
and waiting for a chance to kill me!

25:25.480 --> 25:27.400
Whose side are you on now?

25:27.400 --> 25:28.030
Chu.

25:30.680 --> 25:32.070
But don't worry.

25:32.680 --> 25:35.140
As long as they tell me
everything they know,

25:35.590 --> 25:37.790
I won't make things difficult for them.

25:38.030 --> 25:39.000
Fei Zheng, run!

25:39.480 --> 25:41.340
I will never fall into your hands!

25:48.200 --> 25:49.000
Jin Xi!

25:50.960 --> 25:51.750
Jin Xi!

25:52.830 --> 25:55.160
Jin Xi! Jin Xi!

25:55.350 --> 25:56.550
Why did you do this?

25:56.550 --> 25:57.000
Jin Xi.

25:59.480 --> 26:00.270
Fei Zheng.

26:01.160 --> 26:01.750
We

26:02.680 --> 26:03.480
can't

26:03.830 --> 26:04.880
go back.

26:05.680 --> 26:07.880
This is the best ending.

26:08.510 --> 26:09.440
But

26:10.550 --> 26:12.200
I'm so worried about you.

26:12.750 --> 26:13.610
Physician Han,

26:14.070 --> 26:15.030
your medical skills are exceptional.

26:15.030 --> 26:15.960
Please save her.

26:16.070 --> 26:16.790
I beg you.

26:16.790 --> 26:17.830
Save her, please.

26:22.200 --> 26:23.000
Yunling.

26:23.110 --> 26:24.030
I'm here.

26:24.200 --> 26:24.640
I...

26:26.200 --> 26:29.030
I really miss our days

26:29.030 --> 26:30.830
in Changmo.

26:31.240 --> 26:32.160
Help me

26:32.160 --> 26:33.030
hold on to them.

26:34.480 --> 26:36.200
With my sister,

26:36.200 --> 26:37.270
and you...

26:39.880 --> 26:41.200
Yunling,

26:41.920 --> 26:43.000
the Princess

26:43.440 --> 26:46.400
is an innocent girl.

26:47.640 --> 26:48.480
Please…

26:49.070 --> 26:49.960
For my sake,

26:50.750 --> 26:51.830
go into the palace

26:52.640 --> 26:54.030
and take care of her.

26:54.640 --> 26:55.680
I will.

26:56.160 --> 26:57.030
I will.

27:00.110 --> 27:01.200
Fei Zheng,

27:03.480 --> 27:05.070
like me,

27:05.790 --> 27:06.830
she never had

27:07.550 --> 27:09.640
a choice.

27:10.310 --> 27:11.350
Promise me.

27:13.480 --> 27:14.750
Stay safe.

27:15.110 --> 27:15.960
Don't worry.

27:16.960 --> 27:17.830
I'm fine.

27:18.590 --> 27:20.000
You'll be fine too.

27:21.030 --> 27:22.030
If

27:23.070 --> 27:24.550
there is a next life,

27:25.350 --> 27:26.440
let’s

27:26.920 --> 27:27.480
be

27:27.640 --> 27:29.240
free

27:29.920 --> 27:30.590
people.

27:32.790 --> 27:34.790
Okay.

27:37.590 --> 27:38.480
Jin Xi.

27:38.750 --> 27:39.920
Jin Xi.

27:40.480 --> 27:41.350
Go to sleep.

27:41.350 --> 27:42.030
Jin Xi.

27:42.270 --> 27:43.160
Sleep well.

27:44.240 --> 27:45.550
Jin Xi.

27:52.640 --> 27:54.030
Jin Xi.

28:04.070 --> 28:05.870
I haven't allowed you to die yet!

28:09.240 --> 28:10.160
Guards!

28:10.550 --> 28:12.480
Escort Fei Zheng to the Imperial Prison.

28:12.480 --> 28:13.830
He is still my brother.

28:14.030 --> 28:15.590
If anyone dares to harm him,

28:15.640 --> 28:17.440
they will be severely punished!

28:19.790 --> 28:21.190
Thank you, Your Majesty.

28:38.750 --> 28:40.880
Jin Xi has been with me for seven years.

28:41.270 --> 28:42.550
She is just a woman,

28:43.000 --> 28:44.030
weak and delicate.

28:44.030 --> 28:45.440
How could she be a spy?

28:48.960 --> 28:51.550
Jin Xi and I have known each other
since we were young.

28:51.550 --> 28:54.160
I only recently found out
she knows martial arts.

28:54.160 --> 28:55.880
Was it really Liu Chu

28:56.270 --> 28:58.000
who ordered Jin Xi's death?

28:58.590 --> 29:00.790
The Emperor had no choice.

29:01.240 --> 29:03.300
The situation was urgent at the time.

29:11.350 --> 29:13.160
Have you ever thought about

29:13.510 --> 29:14.480
leaving here

29:14.750 --> 29:16.210
and returning to Changmo?

29:17.880 --> 29:20.540
How can I get out of
this heavily guarded palace?

29:23.200 --> 29:24.830
How can I return to Changmo?

29:25.790 --> 29:27.070
Even if I leave

29:28.680 --> 29:29.880
and the marriage alliance is broken,

29:29.880 --> 29:32.010
will the two countries go to war again?

29:33.000 --> 29:33.350
I...

29:35.240 --> 29:37.440
Are you still unable to move on from him?

29:41.240 --> 29:43.070
He is the father of my child.

29:43.640 --> 29:45.070
He is my husband.

29:46.590 --> 29:49.550
He is the only man
I have ever loved in my life.

30:01.830 --> 30:03.480
If you want to leave here,

30:04.480 --> 30:06.680
Xiao Chi and I will find a way
to help you.

30:12.640 --> 30:13.570
I'm leaving now.

30:16.070 --> 30:17.030
Wait.

30:19.880 --> 30:22.070
Find a place with flowers,

30:22.070 --> 30:23.480
grass, and trees

30:25.200 --> 30:26.790
to bury Jin Xi.

30:28.030 --> 30:28.830
Don't worry.

30:29.310 --> 30:30.960
Jin Xi is also my friend.

30:31.830 --> 30:33.290
I’ll see her off properly.

30:37.270 --> 30:38.030
Take care.
